CLGaugePendingFeesConcreteUnitTest
├── When the gauge has no corresponding pool
│   └── It should return zero amounts
├── When the gauge is not activated
│   └── It should return zero amounts
├── When the emission cap is zero
│   └── It should return zero amounts
├── When gauge fees are zero
│   └── It should return zero amounts
├── When gauge fees are one wei
│   └── It should return zero amounts
└── When gauge fees are greater than one wei
    └── It should subtract the retained wei
